{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53484","headline":"曹成王碑附诗 · 韩愈","name":"曹成王碑附诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太支十三，曹於弟季。\n或亡或微，曹始就事。\n曹之祖王，畏塞绝迁。\n零王黎公，不闻仅存。\n子父易封，三王守名。\n延延百载，以有成王。\n成王之作，一自其躬。\n文被明章，武荐畯功。\n苏枯弱强，龈其奸猖。\n以报於宗，以昭於王。\n王亦有子，处王之所，唯旧之视，蹶蹶陛陛。\n实取实似，刻诗其碑，爲示无止。\n（同前书卷二八）（按：碑云：「乃序而诗之。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53484.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53484","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}